{
 "annotations": {
  "destructiveHint": false,
  "idempotentHint": false,
  "openWorldHint": true,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Verify a company (registry check)"
 },
 "description": "Verify a company against its official register, for onboarding or before paying or signing: an outcome with reasons, checks, warning signals and a proof code you can show an auditor. A registry check, not full KYB.\nUse it to decide about a company. Don't use it for a cheap single read (lookup_company) or with a name (call search_companies first).\nInputs: country FR or ES or GB; identifier as for lookup_company (441639465); optional id_scheme; optional reference (your case id).\nReturns: outcome (verified, partial, unverified; open insolvency never verified) + reasons, checks, signals (present, none_found, not_covered), recent changes, provenance, proof code (FUE-\u2026).\nLimits: 5 units (1 if not found); keyless 20/day. Stored 24 months. France: insolvency from BODACC since 2008. Public contracts won since 2024 (DECP, weekly). Spain: BORME acts since 2 January 2009. UK: no officers or PSCs. No person's name in any answer.\nSearch words: KYB, KYC, verify supplier, v\u00e9rifier une soci\u00e9t\u00e9, verificar empresa.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "country": {
    "description": "ISO country code: FR or ES or GB.",
    "enum": [
     "FR",
     "ES",
     "GB"
